BT 1 0 0 1 0 48.2 Tm 9.2 TL /F1 7 Tf .2 .254902 .333333 rg (Coronary Artery Disease \(CAD\) remains the leading global cause of cardiovascular mortality. While clinical decision-making relies on angiographic cardiac) Tj T* (catheterization, early non-invasive risk screening can dramatically reduce mortality. However, operationalizing machine learning models in healthcare demands rigorous) Tj T* -0.078353 Tw (software engineering, reproducible data governance, zero-leakage feature pipelines, container security, automated CI/CD testing, and real-time observability. This report) Tj T* 0 Tw (documents the design, implementation, and verification of a production-grade MLOps platform developed for the UCI Cleveland Heart Disease dataset. The architecture) Tj T* (delivers ) Tj /F2 7 Tf (96.32% ROC-AUC) Tj /F1 7 Tf ( and ) Tj /F2 7 Tf (89.29% clinical sensitivity) Tj /F1 7 Tf ( with sub-6ms API latency, containerized with non-root security, orchestrated on Kubernetes with HPA, and) Tj T* (monitored via Prometheus and Grafana.) Tj T* ET
